{"unit_id":"tag:034B:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节找出概形（schemes）的若干性质，它们在fppf拓扑（topology）中于基底（base）上是局部（local）的。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"本节研究其性质的对象。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"fppf拓扑。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底","context":"概形性质的基底局部性。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"相对于fppf覆盖的局部性。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:034C:statement","translation":"性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>局部诺特（locally Noetherian）”是fppf拓扑（topology）中的局部（local）性质。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特","context":"概形局部环的诺特性条件。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"用于判定局部性的fppf拓扑。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"局部诺特性质的覆盖局部性。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:034C:proof","translation":"我们将利用引理<REF_0001>。首先注意，“局部诺特（locally Noetherian）”是Zariski拓扑（topology）中的局部（local）性质。这由定义即知，见《性质（Properties）》定义<REF_0002>。接着证明，若<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affines）之间的平坦（flat）、有限表现（finitely presented）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0002>局部诺特（locally Noetherian），则<MATH_0003>局部诺特（locally Noetherian）。这就是《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0003>。最后，必须证明，若<MATH_0004>是仿射概形（affines）之间的满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）、有限表现（finitely presented）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0005>局部诺特（locally Noetherian），则<MATH_0006>局部诺特（locally Noetherian）。这由《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0004>推出。因此引理<REF_0005>的(1)、(2)、(3)成立，证明完成。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"Properties","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表现"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表现"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特","context":"需要检验局部性的概形性质。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"Zariski拓扑。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"性质的Zariski局部性。"},{"source_term":"Properties","target_term":"性质","context":"所引用章节的标题。"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"上升和下降条件中的仿射概形。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"用于检测性质的态射条件。"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表现","context":"用于检测性质的态射条件。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"仿射概形之间的态射。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"所引用章节的标题。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"下降条件中的覆盖态射。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"所引用章节的标题。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0368:statement","translation":"性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>为雅各布森（Jacobson）的”是fppf拓扑（topology）中的局部（local）性质。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Jacobson","target_term":"雅各布森"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Jacobson","target_term":"雅各布森","context":"概形的Jacobson性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"fppf拓扑。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"Jacobson性质的覆盖局部性。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0368:proof","translation":"我们将利用引理<REF_0001>。首先注意，“雅各布森（Jacobson）”是Zariski拓扑（topology）中的局部（local）性质。这就是《性质（Properties）》引理<REF_0002>。接着证明，若<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affines）之间的平坦（flat）、有限表现（finitely presented）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0002>为雅各布森（Jacobson）的，则<MATH_0003>为雅各布森（Jacobson）的。这就是《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0003>。最后，必须证明，若<MATH_0004>是仿射概形（affines）之间的满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）、有限表现（finitely presented）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0005>为雅各布森（Jacobson）的，则<MATH_0006>为雅各布森（Jacobson）的。设<MATH_0007>且<MATH_0008>，并且<MATH_0009>由<MATH_0010>给出。那么<MATH_0011>是有限表现（finitely presented）且忠实平坦（faithfully flat）的。此外，环（ring）<MATH_0012>为雅各布森（Jacobson）的，见《性质（Properties）》引理<REF_0004>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n由《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0005>，存在图（diagram）<MATH_0013>，其中<MATH_0014>有限表现（finitely presented）、忠实平坦（faithfully flat）且拟有限（quasi-finite）。特别地，<MATH_0015>是有限型（finite type）的，而由《代数（Algebra）》命题<REF_0006>可知<MATH_0016>为雅各布森（Jacobson）的。因此，还可以假设<MATH_0017>既拟有限（quasi-finite），又忠实平坦（faithfully flat）且有限表现（finite presentation）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n假设<MATH_0018>不是雅各布森（Jacobson）的，以导出矛盾。由《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0007>，存在一个非极大（nonmaximal）素理想（prime）<MATH_0019>和一个元素（element）<MATH_0020>，<MATH_0021>，使得<MATH_0022>。\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n这如下导致矛盾。首先设<MATH_0023>为<MATH_0024>的一个极大（maximal）理想（ideal）。选取一个位于<MATH_0026>之上的素理想（prime）<MATH_0025>（它存在，因为<MATH_0027>忠实平坦（faithfully flat），见《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0008>）。由于<MATH_0028>平坦（flat），利用下降（going down），见《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0009>，可以找到一个素理想（prime）<MATH_0029>，它位于<MATH_0030>之上。特别地，可知<MATH_0031>不是极大（maximal）的。因此，再次由《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0010>，集合（set）<MATH_0032>是无限（infinite）的（这里终于用到了<MATH_0033>为雅各布森（Jacobson）的）。<MATH_0034>的所有点都映（map）到<MATH_0035>。因此，<MATH_0036>之上的纤维（fibre）是无限（infinite）的。这与<MATH_0037>拟有限（quasi-finite）矛盾（见《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0011>，或更明确地见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0012>）。引理得证。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Jacobson","target_term":"雅各布森"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"sourc