urce_term":"prime","target_term":"素理想","context":"坐标环中的素理想。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"用于局部化的环元素。"},{"source_term":"maximal","target_term":"极大","context":"反证中极大理想的性质。"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想","context":"坐标环中的理想。"},{"source_term":"going down","target_term":"下降","context":"平坦环映射的going down性质，区别于覆盖下降。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"谱中由闭集与主开集的交给出的集合。"},{"source_term":"infinite","target_term":"无限","context":"集合及纤维的点数无限。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映","context":"谱中点的像的动词用法。"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维","context":"所选素理想之上的纤维。"}],"notes":["原文将受保护片段p包含于m放在极大理想的表述中；保留原文及公式，不改写以修复疑似typo。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0BAL:statement","translation":"性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>的每个拟紧开集（quasi-compact open）都有有限（finite）个不可约分支（irreducible components）”是fppf拓扑（topology）中的局部（local）性质。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact open","target_term":"拟紧开集"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"irreducible components","target_term":"不可约分支"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact open","target_term":"拟紧开集","context":"概形的拟紧开子集。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"不可约分支的数量有限。"},{"source_term":"irreducible components","target_term":"不可约分支","context":"拟紧开集的不可约分支。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"fppf拓扑。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"分支有限性相对于覆盖的局部性。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0BAL:proof","translation":"我们将利用引理<REF_0001>。首先注意，<MATH_0001>是Zariski拓扑（topology）中的局部（local）性质。接着证明，若<MATH_0002>是仿射概形（affines）之间的平坦（flat）、有限表现（finitely presented）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0003>有有限（finite）个不可约分支（irreducible components），则<MATH_0004>也如此。事实上，由于<MATH_0005>平坦（flat），<MATH_0006>的一般点（generic points）映（map）到<MATH_0007>的一般点（generic points），见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>。因此，只需证明，对<MATH_0008>，纤维（fibre）<MATH_0009>有有限（finite）个一般点（generic points）。注意，<MATH_0010>是<MATH_0011>上的有限型（finite type）仿射概形（affine scheme），见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0003>。因此，<MATH_0012>是诺特（Noetherian）的，且有有限（finite）个不可约分支（irreducible components）（《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0004>及《性质（Properties）》引理<REF_0005>）。最后，必须证明，若<MATH_0013>是仿射概形（affines）之间的满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）、有限表现（finitely presented）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0014>有有限（finite）个不可约分支（irreducible components），则<MATH_0015>也如此。这由《拓扑（Topology）》引理<REF_0006>推出。因此引理<REF_0007>的(1)、(2)、(3)成立，证明完成。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表现"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"irreducible components","target_term":"不可约分支"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"generic points","target_term":"一般点"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映"},{"source_term":"generic points","target_term":"一般点"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"generic points","target_term":"一般点"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"irreducible components","target_term":"不可约分支"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Properties","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表现"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"irreducible components","target_term":"不可约分支"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"Zariski拓扑。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"性质的Zariski局部性。"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"上升和下降条件中的仿射概形。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"态射的平坦性。"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表现","context":"态射的有限性条件。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"仿射概形之间的态射。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"分支或一般点的数量有限。"},{"source_term":"irreducible components","target_term":"不可约分支","context":"源、目标及纤维的不可约分支。"},{"source_term":"generic points","target_term":"一般点","context":"不可约分支对应的一般点。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映","context":"一般点在态射下的像。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"所引用章节的标题。"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维","context":"目标概形点处的纤维。"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"纤维在剩余域上的有限型性质。"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"剩余域上的纤维。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特","context":"有限型纤维的诺特性。"},{"source_term":"Properties","target_term":"性质","context":"所引用章节的标题。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"用于下降的态射条件。"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"所引用章节的标题。"}],"notes":[]}
