{"unit_id":"tag:0369:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节找出概形（schemes）的若干性质，它们在综平（syntomic）拓扑（topology）中于基底（base）上是局部（local）的。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"综平"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"本节研究的对象。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"综平","context":"综平拓扑，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"综平拓扑。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底","context":"概形性质的基底局部性。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"性质相对于综平覆盖的局部性。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:036A:statement","translation":"性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>局部诺特（locally Noetherian）且满足<MATH_0003>”是综平（syntomic）拓扑（topology）中的局部（local）性质。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"综平"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特","context":"与受保护的深度条件同时要求的概形性质。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"综平","context":"综平拓扑，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"用于下降深度条件的拓扑。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"概形性质的覆盖局部性。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:036A:proof","translation":"我们将检验引理<REF_0001>的(1)、(2)、(3)。由于综平（syntomic）态射（morphism）平坦（flat）且有限表现（finite presentation）（《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>），对“局部诺特（locally Noetherian）”，我们已在引理<REF_0004>的证明中检验过这一点。在证明中将直接使用它，不再另行说明。首先注意，<MATH_0001>是Zariski拓扑（topology）中的局部（local）性质。这由定义即知，见《概形上同调（Cohomology of Schemes）》定义<REF_0005>。接着证明，若<MATH_0002>是仿射概形（affines）之间的综平（syntomic）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0003>具有<MATH_0004>，则<MATH_0005>具有<MATH_0006>。这就是《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0006>（利用《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0007>以及《代数（Algebra）》定义<REF_0008>和引理<REF_0009>）。最后证明，若<MATH_0007>是仿射概形（affines）之间的满射（surjective）综平（syntomic）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0008>具有<MATH_0009>，则<MATH_0010>具有<MATH_0011>。这就是《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0010>。因此引理<REF_0011>的(1)、(2)、(3)成立，证明完成。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"综平"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表现"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"Cohomology of Schemes","target_term":"概形上同调"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"综平"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"综平"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"综平","context":"综平态射的上升和下降作用，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"仿射概形之间的态射。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"综平态射具有的平坦性。"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表现","context":"原文陈述的综平态射有限性。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"所引用章节的标题。"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特","context":"已由前一引理处理的性质。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"Zariski拓扑。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"性质的Zariski局部性。"},{"source_term":"Cohomology of Schemes","target_term":"概形上同调","context":"所引用章节的标题。"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"上升和下降条件中的仿射概形。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"所引用章节的标题。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"用于下降的综平覆盖态射。"}],"notes":["保留原文finite presentation的表述，不依据引用自行改为locally of finite presentation。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:036B:statement","translation":"性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>为科恩–麦考利（Cohen-Macaulay）的”是综平（syntomic）拓扑（topology）中的局部（local）性质。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Cohen-Macaulay","target_term":"科恩–麦考利"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"综平"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Cohen-Macaulay","target_term":"科恩–麦考利","context":"概形的Cohen-Macaulay性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"综平","context":"综平拓扑，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"用于判定局部性的拓扑。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"概形性质的覆盖局部性。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:036B:proof","translation":"这由上面的引理<REF_0001>即知，因为概形（scheme）是科恩–麦考利（Cohen-Macaulay）的，当且仅当它局部诺特（locally Noetherian）且满足<MATH_0001>，对所有<MATH_0002>均如此，见《性质（Properties）》引理<REF_0002>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Cohen-Macaulay","target_term":"科恩–麦考利"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"Properties","target_term":"性质"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"需要检验科恩–麦考利性的对象。"},{"source_term":"Cohen-Macaulay","target_term":"科恩–麦考利","context":"由全部深度条件刻画的概形性质。"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特","context":"该刻画中的有限性条件。"},{"source_term":"Properties","target_term":"性质","context":"所引用章节的标题。"}],"notes":[]}
